sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as 👑 Admin
    participant Shell as 🏠 Shell MFE
    participant Orders as 📦 Orders MFE
    participant NGINX as ⚖️ NGINX
    participant GW as 🚪 API Gateway
    participant OS as 📋 Order Service
    participant PG as 🐘 PostgreSQL
    participant RMQ as 🐰 RabbitMQ
    participant Kafka as 📡 Kafka
    participant NS as 📨 Notification Service
    participant Redis as ⚡ Redis
    participant AS as 📈 Analytics Service

    Note over A, AS: Admin Order Status Update Flow
    
    A->>Shell: Navigate to Orders
    Shell->>Orders: Load Orders MFE
    
    A->>Orders: Click "Admin Panel"
    Orders->>NGINX: GET /api/orders/admin/all
    NGINX->>GW: Route request
    GW->>GW: Verify JWT + Admin role
    GW->>OS: GET /orders/all
    OS->>PG: SELECT * FROM orders
    PG-->>OS: All orders
    OS-->>GW: Orders list
    GW-->>NGINX: Response
    NGINX-->>Orders: Orders data
    Orders-->>A: Display all orders with status buttons
    
    A->>Orders: Click "→ confirmed" on order
    Orders->>NGINX: PUT /api/orders/{id} {status: "confirmed"}
    NGINX->>GW: Route request
    GW->>GW: Verify JWT + Admin role
    GW->>OS: PUT /orders/{id}
    
    OS->>PG: UPDATE orders SET status = 'confirmed'
    PG-->>OS: Order updated
    
    par Publish Events
        OS->>Kafka: Publish ORDER_UPDATED event
        OS->>RMQ: Publish to order.events
        OS->>RMQ: Publish to notification.queue
    end
    
    OS-->>GW: 200 OK {updated order}
    GW->>RMQ: Publish WebSocket notification
    
    par Real-time Updates
        RMQ->>NS: Consume notification
        NS->>Redis: PUBLISH to channel
        Redis->>GW: Notification event
        GW->>Shell: WebSocket push to customer
    and Analytics Update
        Kafka->>AS: Consume ORDER_UPDATED
        AS->>PG: Update analytics aggregations
    end
    
    GW-->>NGINX: Response
    NGINX-->>Orders: Updated order
    Orders-->>A: Update status badge to "confirmed"
    
    Note over A, AS: Customer receives real-time notification
